  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The Gu first appears when Problem Nipped in the Bud Gu pulls a crystal skull from First gen Gu Yue’s aperture, and Lord Sky Crane names it Blood Skull Gu on sight.",
        "chapters": [
          193
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_problem_nipped_in_the_bud_gu",
          "char_first_gen_gu_yue",
          "char_lord_sky_crane"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It is one of the true inheritances of the Blood Sea Ancestor, originally held by Lord Sky Crane before First gen Gu Yue seized it.",
        "chapters": [
          195
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_blood_sea_ancestor"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later snatches and refines it during the Qing Mao Mountain fight.",
        "chapters": [
          197
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Immortal Crane Sect elders list Blood Sea’s nine true inheritances: blood skull Gu, blood handprint Gu, blood qi Gu, blood sweat Gu, menses blood Gu, blood shadow Gu, blood battle Gu, the ancient desolate beast violent blood dragon bat, and the rank six Immortal Gu blood deity. The same speech calls Blood Sea Ancestor someone who achieved great success in blood path, and says the blood skull Gu true inheritance is with Fang Yuan.",
        "chapters": [
          407
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blood-sea-true-inheritance-list",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
          "loc_blood_sea",
          "gu_blood_handprint_gu",
          "gu_blood_qi_gu",
          "gu_blood_sweat_gu",
          "gu_blood_shadow_gu",
          "gu_blood_battle_gu",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "path_blood"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "As an immortal zombie, Fang Yuan judges that mortal blood skull Gu cannot raise his own aptitude even if he kills many descendants, and that only blood skull Immortal Gu would work on him. He also notes he would need the Immortal Gu recipe and would face extreme tribulation risk if he pushed aptitude toward a ten extreme physique for revival.",
        "chapters": [
          857
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "immortal-gu-plans",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_recipe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan creates a blood skull Immortal Gu recipe from natural inspiration and deduction, then refines blood skull Immortal Gu. Its effect is still to raise aptitude, now usable on Gu Immortals, with the same blood-kin killing cost at a much higher scale. Fang Yuan had once used the rank four mortal Gu to raise his aptitude by slaughtering almost the whole Gu Yue village. Blood Skull is also among Fang Yuan’s blood path Immortal Gu when Giant Sun Immortal Venerable seeks those worms, which assigns the Immortal Gu to blood path in plain words.",
        "chapters": [
          2252
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blood-skull-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "sys_mortal_gu",
          "loc_gu_yue_village",
          "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
